{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the ultimate sports showdown with <strong>BlastBall: All-Stars!</strong> Pick your favorite all-star from our roster of adorable creatures and jump into the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Sports_Action.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Gameplay2.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With intuitive controls adapted to each sport, jumping into new games is a breeze! Aim with the left stick and add spin with the right stick to score <strong>highlight reel goals</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Trickshot.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/InstantReplay.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hitting the ball builds your blast meter, allowing you to unleash powerful blast shots! Need to see that goal again? Then don't skip that replay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Couch_Multiplayer.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 friends</strong>\u00a0can play Air Hockey, Soccer, Dodgeball, and Volleyball in this\u00a0<strong>demo</strong>!\u00a0Need some pickup players? Add a few bots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Tournaments.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Options.gif?t=1741382946\" />Battle it out in simplified <strong>fan-favorite sports</strong> like soccer, gaga ball, volleyball, and air hockey. Can\u2019t decide what to play first? Compete in a <i>multi-sport tournament</i> to prove who\u2019s the true champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Mix_things_up.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Items2.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're looking to bend the rules, go right ahead! We have a bunch of options and items to keep your opponents guessing. Giant players, tiny pucks, screwballs, mini bumpers... and many more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Keep_It_Moving.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/BlastShots.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only have a few minutes to play? Get a match going\u00a0<i>in less than 30 seconds</i>. We can't help if you don't want to stop, though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Fan_Favorite_Sports.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Menu.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got your favorite sports covered (or we're working on it, at least..), and we plan to keep expanding the game with more sports and modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Unique_All-Stars.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Characters.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Becca, Reggie, Blaire, and Kazuo are <strong>ready to play</strong> in the demo! Each character brings unique stats and styles to keep players on their toes. Give the<strong> FREE DEMO</strong>\u00a0a try today!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230830?t=1741382946","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230830?t=1741382946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/d79add2a3b76c7eacc27d06258ebb77925a9e9c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741382946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/d79add2a3b76c7eacc27d06258ebb77925a9e9c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741382946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the ultimate sports showdown with <strong>BlastBall: All-Stars!</strong> Pick your favorite all-star from our roster of adorable creatures and jump into the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Sports_Action.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Gameplay2.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With intuitive controls adapted to each sport, jumping into new games is a breeze! Aim with the left stick and add spin with the right stick to score <strong>highlight reel goals</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Trickshot.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/InstantReplay.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hitting the ball builds your blast meter, allowing you to unleash powerful blast shots! Need to see that goal again? Then don't skip that replay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Couch_Multiplayer.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 friends</strong>\u00a0can play Air Hockey, Soccer, Dodgeball, and Volleyball in this\u00a0<strong>demo</strong>!\u00a0Need some pickup players? Add a few bots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Tournaments.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Options.gif?t=1741382946\" />Battle it out in simplified <strong>fan-favorite sports</strong> like soccer, gaga ball, volleyball, and air hockey. Can\u2019t decide what to play first? Compete in a <i>multi-sport tournament</i> to prove who\u2019s the true champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Mix_things_up.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Items2.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're looking to bend the rules, go right ahead! We have a bunch of options and items to keep your opponents guessing. Giant players, tiny pucks, screwballs, mini bumpers... and many more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Keep_It_Moving.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/BlastShots.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only have a few minutes to play? Get a match going\u00a0<i>in less than 30 seconds</i>. We can't help if you don't want to stop, though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Fan_Favorite_Sports.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Menu.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got your favorite sports covered (or we're working on it, at least..), and we plan to keep expanding the game with more sports and modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Unique_All-Stars.png?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Characters.gif?t=1741382946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Becca, Reggie, Blaire, and Kazuo are <strong>ready to play</strong> in the demo! Each character brings unique stats and styles to keep players on their toes. Give the<strong> FREE DEMO</strong>\u00a0a try today!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Will Winn Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3170060","name":"BlastBall: All-Stars"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/header.jpg?t=1741382946","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Will Winn Games, Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257061512,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061512/movie480.mp4?t=1740602101","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061512/movie_max.mp4?t=1740602101"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257061512/65c3d9b0d1bdf991b4a5510a1e65136a27b6e843/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740602101","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061512/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740602101","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061512/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740602101"}}],"name":"BlastBall: All-Stars Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requ